  "Weekly expense report":"Reporte semanal de gastos","Same layout as the IB Group expense form. Log each expense (snap the receipt and the fields fill in), and it lands in the right cell of the week.":"Mismo formato que el formulario de gastos de IB Group. Registra cada gasto (fotografía el recibo y los campos se llenan) y cae en la celda correcta de la semana.","Previous week":"Semana anterior","Next week":"Semana siguiente","Download week (.xlsx)":"Descargar semana (.xlsx)","Add expense":"Agregar gasto","New expense":"Nuevo gasto","Edit expense":"Editar gasto","Receipt first, then check the fields":"Primero el recibo, luego revisa los campos","Upload a receipt":"Subir un recibo","Photo or screenshot (JPG, PNG). The page reads it and fills vendor, date, amount and a suggested category. Always check before submitting.":"Foto o captura (JPG, PNG). La página lo lee y llena proveedor, fecha, monto y una categoría sugerida. Revisa siempre antes de enviar.","Choose receipt":"Elegir recibo","Date":"Fecha","Category":"Categoría","Transportation":"Transporte","Lodging & Meals":"Hospedaje y Comidas","Lodging & meals":"Hospedaje y comidas","Miscellaneous":"Varios","Miles Driven":"Millas Recorridas","Miles Reimbursement":"Reembolso por Millas","Parking And Tolls":"Estacionamiento y Peajes","Auto Rental":"Renta de Auto","Taxi / Limo":"Taxi / Limusina","Fuel":"Combustible","Airfare":"Boleto de Avión","Lodging":"Hospedaje","Breakfast":"Desayuno","Lunch":"Almuerzo","Dinner":"Cena","Snack":"Refrigerio","Supplies":"Insumos","Equipment":"Equipo","Phone, Fax, Internet":"Teléfono, Fax, Internet","Other*":"Otro*","Entertainment*":"Entretenimiento*","Vendor":"Proveedor","Where":"Dónde","Amount ($)":"Monto ($)","Miles":"Millas","Odometer start":"Odómetro inicial","Odometer end":"Odómetro final","Trip counter":"Contador de viajes","Trips":"Viajes","+1 trip":"+1 viaje","× miles each":"× millas cada uno","Client / purpose":"Cliente / propósito","Who it was for, which project":"Para quién fue, qué proyecto","Optional":"Opcional","Add to report":"Agregar al reporte","Week total":"Total de la semana","Company":"Empresa","Employee":"Empleado","Department":"Departamento","Business Development":"Desarrollo de Negocios","Week ending":"Semana que termina","Mileage rate":"Tarifa por milla","/ mile":"/ milla","Authorized by":"Autorizado por","TOTAL":"TOTAL","GRAND TOTALS":"TOTALES GENERALES","LODGING & MEALS":"HOSPEDAJE Y COMIDAS","TRANSPORTATION":"TRANSPORTE","MISCELLANEOUS":"VARIOS","Total expenses":"Total de gastos","IB Group prepaid advances":"Anticipos de IB Group","Total reimbursement":"Reembolso total","Comments":"Comentarios","Please attach all receipts — they're listed below.":"Adjunta todos los recibos — se listan abajo.","Expenses this week":"Gastos de esta semana","Receipt":"Recibo","Missing":"Falta","No expenses this week. Click \"Add expense\" and upload the receipt.":"Sin gastos esta semana. Haz clic en \"Agregar gasto\" y sube el recibo.","Receipt attached. Text reading is unavailable offline — fill the fields in by hand.":"Recibo adjunto. La lectura de texto no está disponible sin conexión — llena los campos a mano.","Preparing image…":"Preparando imagen…","Reading receipt…":"Leyendo recibo…","Spreadsheet library did not load.":"La librería de hojas de cálculo no cargó.",
